        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, we enhanced our focus on the development and promotion of offerings to help our customers accelerate their digital transformations.",
        "start_character": 12866,
        "end_character": 13010
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001770450-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001770450-26-000009-ca0d5e5e3d978820",
        "accession_number": "0001770450-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we continue to focus on broadening our footprint to sell offerings to the small and mid-sized markets primarily in the U.S., the U.K., and Canada through Xerox Business Solutions (XBS) which is comprised of regional core companies that provide office technology and services.",
        "start_character": 32467,
        "end_character": 32755
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001770450-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001770450-26-000009-ca0d5e5e3d978820",
        "accession_number": "0001770450-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe Xerox’s globally recognizable brand, our deep understanding of clients’ industries and businesses, and clients' trust have afforded us a path to compete in IT Solutions and Digital Services, markets where we already have leading solutions and where we are actively investing to develop more.",
        "start_character": 5254,
        "end_character": 5556
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001770450-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001770450-26-000009-ca0d5e5e3d978820",
        "accession_number": "0001770450-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that this structure creates a leaner and more effective go-to-market model that streamlines our supply chain and provides our clients with best-in-class services.",
        "start_character": 33329,
        "end_character": 33502
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001770450-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001770450-26-000009-ca0d5e5e3d978820",
        "accession_number": "0001770450-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continued to expand collection and waste reduction programs, while also bringing to market additional remanufactured and refurbished product offerings.",
        "start_character": 23042,
        "end_character": 23196
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001770450-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001770450-26-000009-ca0d5e5e3d978820",
        "accession_number": "0001770450-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We go to market with a client-centric, market-informed, and services-led approach, selling workplace products and solutions that support the hybrid workplace and distributed workforce.",
        "start_character": 32044,
        "end_character": 32228
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001770450-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001770450-26-000009-ca0d5e5e3d978820",
        "accession_number": "0001770450-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide the most comprehensive portfolio of MPS services in the industry and are recognized as an industry leader by major analyst firms including IDC and Quocirca.",
        "start_character": 13267,
        "end_character": 13434
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001770450-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001770450-26-000009-ca0d5e5e3d978820",
        "accession_number": "0001770450-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We will continue to leverage the Global Business Services (GBS) organization to design and implement continuous operating efficiencies.",
        "start_character": 4081,
        "end_character": 4216
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001770450-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001770450-26-000009-ca0d5e5e3d978820",
        "accession_number": "0001770450-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we have materials and components manufacturing operations in Wilsonville, Oregon, Oklahoma City, Oklahoma, and Boulder Colorado.",
        "start_character": 37506,
        "end_character": 37647
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001770450-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001770450-26-000009-ca0d5e5e3d978820",
        "accession_number": "0001770450-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our largest manufacturing sites are located in Webster, New York, where we produce key components and consumables, including toner, and Juarez, Mexico, which serves as a primary hub for printer and supplies manufacturing and assembly, and further expands the scale and geographic diversity of our combined footprint.",
        "start_character": 37189,
        "end_character": 37505
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001770450-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001770450-26-000009-ca0d5e5e3d978820",
        "accession_number": "0001770450-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a leader in this area of the market and offer a wide range of MFPs, digital printing presses and light production devices, as well as solutions that deliver flexibility and advanced features.",
        "start_character": 10401,
        "end_character": 10599
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001770450-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001770450-26-000009-ca0d5e5e3d978820",
        "accession_number": "0001770450-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We plan to continue to leverage the GBS organization to design and implement continuous operating efficiencies and further utilize Lexmark’s global capability centers in the Philippines, Hungary, and India.",
        "start_character": 5881,
        "end_character": 6087
      }
